    "Gradually reduce volume before pausing when the sleep timer expires. 0 pauses instantly." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the sleep timer's fade out stepper in the Playback settings."
    },
    "Heading" : {
      "comment" : "A unit of text a picker moves or rewinds by: one heading. Used by the rewind, skip, and navigation unit pickers."
